<title>USA: Storms threaten shipping off Solomon Islands - WSC.</title>
<headline>Storms threaten shipping off Solomon Islands - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical cyclone Fergus will be a significant risk to shipping off the Solomon Islands, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp (WSC) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The tropical cyclone was expected to track from southeast of the islands to west of the Vanuatu islands during the next 36-48 hours.</p>
